# 🔄 e. Building Complete CRUD Workflows

A complete CRUD workflow combines all four operations into one API.

For example, consider a **Product API**.

### API Endpoints

| Operation | HTTP Method | Endpoint | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| Create | POST | `/api/products/` | Create a product |
| Read | GET | `/api/products/` | Get all products |
| Read | GET | `/api/products/1/` | Get one product |
| Update | PUT | `/api/products/1/` | Replace a product |
| Update | PATCH | `/api/products/1/` | Partially update a product |
| Delete | DELETE | `/api/products/1/` | Delete a product |

### Complete CRUD Flow

```text
              Product API
                   │
       ┌───────────┼───────────┐
       ↓           ↓           ↓
     Create       Read       Update
     POST         GET       PUT/PATCH
       │           │           │
       └───────────┼───────────┘
                   ↓
                Delete
                 DELETE
```

